and other laws;</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&#160;</p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top">
