and customers to our portfolio. If the establishment of highly diverse network connectivity to our data centers does not occur, is materially
delayed or is discontinued, or is subject to failure, our operating results and cash flow may be materially adversely affected. Additionally,
any hardware or fiber failures on this network may result in significant loss of connectivity to our data centers. This could negatively
affect our ability to attract new customers or retain existing customers, which could have an adverse effect on our business, financial
