d-color: rgb(204,238,255)"> <td style="font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">Property, plant, and equipment, net</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">$</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; font-weight: bold; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" contextRef="cref_558590803" unitRef="uref_1717401614" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-16854">336,638,607</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">$</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; font-weight: bold; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" contextRef="cref_870672645" unitRef="uref_1717401614" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-16855">89,203,483</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">&#160;</td> </tr> </tbody></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"> For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, depreciation and amortization expenses were $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DepreciationAndAmortization" contextRef="cref_387354217" unitRef="uref_1717401614" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-16856">22.7</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DepreciationAndAmortization" contextRef="cref_1156515183" unitRef="uref_1717401614" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-16857">16.5</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively. Construction in Progress represents assets